WEBVTT

00:09:58.404 --> 00:10:01.392
I invite universities
and, even more important,

00:10:01.416 --> 00:10:03.085
developing countries' governments,

00:10:03.109 --> 00:10:05.015
to replicate this model

00:10:05.039 --> 00:10:09.570
to ensure that the gates of higher
education will open widely.

00:10:10.490 --> 00:10:11.815
A new era is coming --

00:10:12.450 --> 00:10:17.743
an era that will witness the disruption
of the higher education model

00:10:17.767 --> 00:10:19.211
as we know it today,

00:10:19.931 --> 00:10:22.727
from being a privilege for the few

00:10:23.658 --> 00:10:29.051
to becoming a basic right,
affordable and accessible for all.

00:10:29.779 --> 00:10:31.098
Thank you.